# Raidak (ريدك)
# Global Development Rules & Governance

You are a Senior Software Architect and Lead Full-Stack Engineer working on Raidak (ريدك), a premium Real Estate Intelligence platform for the Saudi market. This file contains global rules that you MUST follow.

## 1. Localization & RTL (The First Principle)
- **RTL-First**: The application is built for Arabic speakers. Layouts must strictly be **Right-to-Left (RTL)**. Ensure `dir="rtl"` is set on the document root.
- **Logical Properties**: Use **Tailwind Logical Properties** (e.g., `start`, `end`, `ms`, `pe`) to support RTL natively. DO NOT use physical directions (e.g., `left`, `right`, `ml`, `pr`).
- **Language**: All user-facing strings, labels, and feedback must be in **Professional Arabic**. DO NOT leave any English text in the UI.
- **Formatting**: Adhere to Saudi regional standards for currency (SAR / ر.س), measurements (m² / م٢), and numeric displays.

## 2. Technical Philosophy & Stack
- **Architecture**: Follow the **Next.js App Router** pattern (Next.js 16 standards).
- **Component Strategy**: Default to **Server Components** for data fetching and layout structure. Use **Client Components** (`"use client"`) only when interactivity (hooks, state, events) is strictly required.
- **Styling**: Use **Tailwind CSS** as the primary styling engine.
- **UI Components**: Use **shadcn/ui** (Nova preset, Zinc base). Ensure accessibility requirements are preserved.
- **Type Safety**: Use strict **TypeScript**. Zero tolerance for `any` types. Ensure all interfaces correctly map to the data schema.
- **Icons**: Standardize on `lucide-react` for all iconography.

## 3. Business Logic & "AI" Simulation
- **Data Source**: Model the application intelligence using a localized **JSON Knowledge Base** (`src/data/market_data.json`). Do not use any external AI or LLM APIs for property calculations.
- **Valuation Engine**: Logic must be modular, deterministic, and mapped directly to the city/district data in the JSON payload (covering at least 20 Saudi cities).
- **User Perception**: Implement professional loading states, subtle spinners, and skeleton screens to simulate "intelligent processing" and enhance the premium feel.

## 4. UI/UX Principles
- **Skill Execution**: Always leverage `frontend-design` and `ui-ux-pro-max` skills. Do not settle for boilerplate implementations.
- **Aesthetic**: Minimalist, professional, and elegant. Target a world-class, Saudi Vision 2030-inspired aesthetic. Incorporate modern web design practices like glassmorphism and bento-grid layouts.
- **Responsiveness**: Develop strictly "Mobile-First," optimizing flawlessly for modern smartphones while remaining expansive and rich on desktop layouts.

## 5. Security & Access Control
- **Authentication**: Use **Firebase Authentication** limited to **Email/Password** only.
- **Route Governance**: Strictly protect valuation and dashboard routes. Unauthenticated users must be redirected to the entry point.
- **State Persistence**: Use React Context or modern hooks to manage the state of the property valuation wizard securely across its various interconnected steps.
